1
00:00:03,958 --> 00:00:05,140
Let's zoom in!

2
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,000
Are they on its legs, like Chirp?

3
00:00:07,458 --> 00:00:08,271
Nope!

4
00:00:08,291 --> 00:00:10,491
Its ears are on its tummy!

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,120
But WHY on its tummy?

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,620
To hear other grasshoppers sing!

7
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,060
Many grasshoppers sing with their legs!

8
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,090
They rub a back

9
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,450
leg on a wing!

10
00:00:22,048 --> 00:00:24,388
And its back legs are like springs!

11
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:25,840
Look at it go!

12
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,360
A bug band!

13
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,900
Tummy ears, and legs that sing!

14
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,100
Six legs? In you go!

15
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,350
Play it again! Louder!

16
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:40,450
Oops! Too loud!

17
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,900
Tummy ears, and legs that sing!

18
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:45,390
Where are YOUR ears?
